      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks for the outline. i really like how you framed it. especially the part about the other side being a regressive stance against change. i want the kids to really grasp how outdated those views are compared to the revolutionary ones. \n\ncan you give me some specific discussion questions i could use in class? i want them to be able to identify why the regressive arguments don't really hold up in a modern society.",
