      "content": "Ask students to analyze historical examples, like Jim Crow laws or redlining, to see how \"equality of opportunity\" was a complete sham. Challenge them with the question: \"If the starting line is different for everyone, is it fair to judge the race solely on who crosses the finish line first?\" Finally, ask them to debate whether clinging to outdated ideas of meritocracy ignores the undeniable reality of inherited privilege.",
